    description_en: "Spider-Man Noir swings from the shadows in his distinctive black and white costume from the noir universe. This darker, grittier version of Spider-Man operates in a 1930s Great Depression setting where Peter Parker fights organized crime with detective skills and web-slinging action. The monochrome design and vintage aesthetic made this character a standout in Into the Spider-Verse. Highly sought after for Spider-Verse displays and alternate universe Spider-Man collections.",
